# Mister Hyde, Monster Within: "At the beginning of your upkeep, choose one - Put a +1/+1 counter on Mister Hyde; or remove a counter from a
# creature you control. If you do, draw a card." Turn 3 upkeep: the counter on Hyde (3/3); Bot1 then casts Grizzly Bears and gives them a
